===Noun===
{{en-noun|butterfly fish|+}}

# Any fish of the family {{taxfmt|Chaetodontidae|family}}.
# {{taxlink|Pantodon buchholzi|species}}, a small brown fish of western African streams, often found in aquariums.
# The {{vern|butterfly cod}} ({{taxlink|Pterois volitans|species}}).
# The {{vern|ocellated blenny}} ({{taxlink|Opisthocentrus ocellatus|species}}).
# The [[flying gurnard]] ({{taxlink|Dactyloptena orientalis|species}}).
# {{taxlink|Exocoetus volitans|species}}, a [[flying fish]] of the Atlantic.
# A [[chiton]], a [[mollusc]] of the class {{taxfmt|Polyplacophora|class}}.
# Any of several brightly colored fishes

